1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,767
Give your iced latte a sugar cookie twist.

2
00:00:02,767 --> 00:00:06,700
Start with simple syrup, vanilla, and a drop of almond extract.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,967
Pour espresso and your milk of choice over ice.

4
00:00:09,967 --> 00:00:13,200
Stir in a little syrup. Taste before adding more.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,933
A pinch of salt can bring out the cookie flavor.
